{"id":"00540","root":"uni00540_1","name":{"ja":"セシリア・チェロ","en":"Cecilia Cello"},"title":{"ja":"【めりーチョコります！】","en":"【Merry Chocolate!】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【めりーチョコります！】 セシリア・チェロ","en":"【Merry Chocolate!】 Cecilia Cello"},"element":"Science","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2021-12-16","limited":true,"characterId":55,"profile":{"ja":"米連の研究所で生まれた女の子。遺伝子操作で人工的に作られた彼女は、生まれつき強力な魔力を扱える。米連の研究者たちから英才教育を受けさせられて育ち、学力や身体能力も高い。生命無きモノに魔力を与え、彼女の意思通り操るという能力を持つが、魔力を激しく消耗してしまうのが欠点。それを補うため、かばんやポシェットには甘いお菓子をたくさん常備してある。クリスマスが近づき、米連基地もお祭りムードになると、セシリアはいつもの兵装をクリスマス仕様にアレンジしてもらい任務に赴く。この兵装でいると、子供たちからやたらにプレゼントをねだられるが、心優しいセシリアは大事なお菓子を分けてあげて皆で食べるのだった。","en":"She was born in a United Nations research facility. Artificially created through genetic engineering, she innately wields powerful magical energy. Raised under the gifted-education program of UN researchers, she possesses exceptional academic and physical abilities. She can imbue lifeless objects with magic and command them at will, though it rapidly drains her mana. To compensate, her bag and satchel are always stocked with plenty of sweet snacks. As Christmas approaches and the UN base gets festive, Cecilia has her usual gear remodeled in a Christmas style for missions. While wearing this gear, children constantly beg her for presents, but the kind-hearted Cecilia shares her precious sweets so everyone can eat together."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"民安ともえ","forms":[{"id":"uni00540_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1252,2504],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[103,206],"def":[139,278],"spd":[52,52],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","1310007"]},{"id":"uni00540_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[2004,4008],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[141,282],"def":[213,426],"spd":[52,52],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["5","1310007","1310008"]},{"id":"uni00540_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2756,5510],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[184,369],"def